From: virtudude <virtudude@protonmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] launcher: forward only the debug ports, on loopback

Applies to the launcher Steam installs (app 3029110).

Automatic forwarding publishes every port the container listens on to all
host addresses, including adb, which accepts unauthenticated connections.
The launcher only needs adb, through localhost.

---
--- a/liblepton/networking.sh
+++ b/liblepton/networking.sh
@@ -111,8 +111,7 @@
     # We need to map the gateway otherwise steamclient can't connect.
     PODMAN_NETWORK_OPTIONS+=" --map-gw"
 
-    PODMAN_NETWORK_OPTIONS+=" -t auto"
-    PODMAN_NETWORK_OPTIONS+=" -u auto"
+    PODMAN_NETWORK_OPTIONS+=" -t 127.0.0.1/$((5555 + $(lepton_port_offset)))"
     PODMAN_NETWORK_OPTIONS+=" --no-splice"
 
     # Since the dns is configured to this address in generate_ipconfig_txt we
